--======================================================================
--  pause_mover.tyro - helper sprite script for test_pause_probe.tyro
--======================================================================
--  Moves its sprite 1px right on every engine Update (per-frame on_update).
--  The engine only calls on_update while the scene is not paused, so the
--  sprite's x is a direct read-out of whether the scene is running.
--======================================================================

function on_update()
  self.x = self.x + 1
end
